<title>UK: GECC prices $300 million 13-year bond, 33 bp over.</title>
<headline>GECC prices $300 million 13-year bond, 33 bp over.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, lead manager Goldman Sachs International said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $300 MLN  COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    11.JUN.10</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.084   PAY DATE    11.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.125     REOFFER    99.334    SPREAD	+33 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NES YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.625 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 15.MAY.07</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
